msgid "For every location, studio, or shop that has lat/lng but no district set, this calls OSM Nominatim to reverse-geocode the pin and extract the 4-digit Wien postcode (e.g. \"1010\"). The district filter on the unified /locations/ map then has data to filter on. Nominatim is rate-limited to 1 req/sec so this batches 20 entries per click — repeat until 0 remain."
